OL,3,AHeart attack patient, 83, had to drive
OL,4,Afour hours for hospital appointment
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 83-year-old recovering cancer
OL,7,Fpatient who has suffered two heart
OL,8,Fattacks was forced to drive himself on
OL,9,Fa four-hour round trip for medical
OL,10,Ftests.
OL,12,FCharles Swift was referred to Withybush
OL,13,FHospital in Haverfordwest,
OL,14,FPembrokeshire, for tests on his heart
OL,15,Fin August - he lives in Borth,
OL,16,FCeredigion - which is 70 miles away.
OL,18,FHe made inquiries about getting
OL,19,Fnon-emergency transport but was refused
OL,20,Fby a call handler from the Welsh
OL,21,FAmbulance Services Trust (WAST) when he
OL,22,Ftold them he owned a car.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
